> Substitute regular condensed milk for a non-vegan option!

To make this recipe, start by chopping and freezing the @frozen watermelon chunks{2%cups} overnight.

The next day, when you're ready to make this recipe, remove the fruit from the #freezer{} and using a #box grater{} or a #microplane{}, grate the fruit into a #bowl{}. You'll want to work quickly, so that the fruit doesn't melt!

Once your fruit is all grated, top the shaved ice with the @coconut condensed milk{2%teaspoons} and @tajin seasoning{2%teaspoons}. Serve immediately, and enjoy!